Z||000000||PearlBlueSoul||02-08-2001||04:00 PM||||HEy guys.  I appologize for MR2 and FIERO owner's stupidity.  I didn't know he was coming over here.  He ended up starting a thread directing us to your bbs, also known as MR-BAD on our bbs.  He's a nusance even to us (with wonderful Leafcharged MR2 ideas   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">).  Sorry bout the flame.  <P>Cliff, Feel free to Ban him if you desire.  I'm highly doubtful he won't be more of a nusance than a help.<P>Dan Shaw<BR>AKA PearlBlueSoul@ board.mr2pages.com (O/T moderator)<P>------------------<BR>1987 Toyota MR2 N/A 5 speed<BR>  <A HREF="http://www.atlantamr2s.com" TARGET=_blank>http://www.atlantamr2s.com</A>  <BR><A HREF="http://www.geocities.com/darionscard" TARGET=_blank>http://www.geocities.com/darionscard</A>  <BR>     <IMG SRC="http://www.geocities.com/darionscard/Thumb.jpg">        <BR><B>Notable mods:</B>  Sus tech springs and sway bars, Toyota strut tower brace, KYB strut inserts, HKS exhaust, NGK plugs/wires, Momo Racer wheels (14x6), Custom intake, Kenwood 12" speaker in front trunk, Jensen amp.<p>[This message has been edited by PearlBlueSoul (edited 02-08-2001).]||||reg||1
